From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fluorite Integration Role
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 18:30:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] filament_scene: keep v2 scene camera out of ECS init

The v2 deserializer creates scene.camera as the ViewTarget primary camera,
not as an ECS entity.  Do not initialize the Dart camera as an ECS entity
after the platform view is created.

---
 packages/filament_scene/lib/scene/scene_widget.dart | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/packages/filament_scene/lib/scene/scene_widget.dart b/packages/filament_scene/lib/scene/scene_widget.dart
--- a/packages/filament_scene/lib/scene/scene_widget.dart
+++ b/packages/filament_scene/lib/scene/scene_widget.dart
@@ -200 +200,2 @@ class _SceneViewState extends State<SceneView> {
-      widget.cameras?.forEach((final camera) => camera.initialize(widget.filament));
+      // v2 scene.camera is a native ViewTarget camera, not an ECS entity.
+      // Initializing it here would fail the native entity existence check.
--
